ects to L8 and maybe future with J10? Not strong.  \n\nBest move: **F7**.  \n\n**Reason:**  \nF7 creates a diagonal open 3 (H9–G8–F7) with two open ends (E6 and D5 available), which is a winning threat in two moves. It also partly blocks Black’s possible diagonal from I7–E3. It’s the strongest offensive move available.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n```json\n{"col": "F", "row": 7}\n```'}
